OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo will bring severe
OL,6,Fgales and heavy showers, rain turning
OL,7,Frather persistent at times. Winds
OL,8,Fgradually easing from the south with
OL,9,Fdrier interludes developing later in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPersistent rain clearing
OL,13,FCaithness. Otherwise frequent showers
OL,14,Ffrom the west in the evening will
OL,15,Fgradually ease overnight. Severe gales
OL,16,Fin the north at first. Winds gradually
OL,17,Feasing through the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
