OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMostly dry and bright morning,
OL,6,Fjust the odd light shower possible
OL,7,Faround the coasts. Becoming windy with
OL,8,Frain spreading north from late morning.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,11,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, some
OL,12,Fheavy. Winds easing overnight into
OL,13,FWednesday, then bright spells and
OL,14,Fscattered showers. Variable cloud and
OL,15,Fbright spells Thursday, freshening
OL,16,Fwinds later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
